  mac5_d1  #6
  mac5_a1  0.3
  mac6_d1  #18
  mac6_a1  0.4
  mac7_d1  #3
  mac7_a1  0.15
  mac8_d1  #2
  mac8_a1  0.5
  # A saw hard-synced to a sine at the note. An envelope sweeps the saw's
  # ratio down over the first third of a second, which is the sync sweep;
