  mac6_a1  0.4
  mac7_d1  #3
  mac7_a1  0.15
  mac8_d1  #2
  mac8_a1  -0.3
  # The same six operators wired two ways, one long chain and all five into
  # the first, with a slow LFO morphing between them. Every operator is on
