  mac8_d1  #21
  mac8_a1  0.4
  mac8_d2  #22
  mac8_a2  0.4
  # Two slow LFOs, one swinging the morph between three pairs and a
  # cross-wired four-carrier shape, one swinging the skew. The partials
  # come and go and the chord never quite repeats.
